    "Practice mode: reviewing ahead of schedule won't change due dates." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Övningsläge: att repetera i förväg ändrar inte schemat."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "练习模式：提前复习不会改变复习日期。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Predicted recall if you stop reviewing today. Each review resets a word's curve and makes it decay more slowly — that's why the app schedules reviews just before you'd forget." : {
      "localizations" : {
        "sv" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "Beräknat minne om du slutar repetera idag. Varje repetition startar om ordets kurva och gör att den sjunker långsammare – därför schemalägger appen repetitioner precis innan du skulle glömma."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans" : {
          "stringUnit" : {
            "state" : "translated",
            "value" : "如果从今天起不再复习，预计的记忆保持率。每次复习都会重置单词的曲线，并让遗忘变慢——所以应用会在你快要忘记之前安排复习。"
          }
        }
      }
